---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const pillars=[
{letter:'G',name:'Gear',image:'/images/Gear_G.png',description:'Put essential protective equipment within reach.',url:'/programs/#gear'},
{letter:'E',name:'Education',image:'/images/Gear_E.png',description:'Build skills and confidence through quality training.',url:'/programs/#education'},
{letter:'A',name:'Assistance',image:'/images/Gear_A.png',description:'Connect riders with trusted people, services and resources.',url:'/programs/#assistance'},
{letter:'R',name:'Recovery',image:'/images/Gear_R.png',description:'Help riders and families rebuild after a crash.',url:'/programs/#recovery'}
];
---
<Base title="Riders Helping Riders" description="GEAR Moto Foundation is building access to motorcycle safety gear, rider education, assistance and crash recovery support. All bikes. All riders.">
<section class="new-hero"><img class="new-hero-img" src="/images/gear-moto-foundation-riders-supporting-riders-hero.jpg" alt="" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="new-hero-shade"></div><div class="wrap hero-content"><div class="hero-kicker"><span class="red-line"></span> RIDERS HELPING RIDERS</div><h1>THE RIDE<br/>CONNECTS US.<br/><em>THE MISSION<br/>MOVES US.</em></h1><p>More than motorcycles. We're building a community that helps riders get equipped, ride smarter, find support and recover when life changes in an instant.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-red" href="/programs/">Explore Our Mission <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="btn hero-outline" href="/volunteer/">Be Part of GEAR <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div><div class="hero-scroll" aria-hidden="true">SCROLL TO EXPLORE ↓</div></section>
<section class="intro-band"><div class="wrap intro-band-grid"><div><span class="section-label">WHY WE EXIST</span><h2>A stronger riding community starts with all of us.</h2></div><div><p>When riders look out for one another, the impact goes far beyond the road. GEAR connects the passion of the motorcycle community with a clear, practical purpose.</p><a class="text-arrow" href="/about/">Discover our story <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="pillar-section" id="the-pillars"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-label">THE FOUR PILLARS</span><h2>FOUR LETTERS.<br/><span>ONE MISSION.</span></h2></div><p>From the first helmet to the road back after a crash, every part of GEAR serves a purpose.</p></div><div class="modern-pillar-grid">{pillars.map((p,i)=><a class="modern-pillar" href={p.url}><div class="pillar-top"><span class="pillar-number">0{i+1} / 04</span><span class="pillar-link" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><img src={p.image} alt="" loading="lazy"/><div class="pillar-bottom"><h3>{p.name}</h3><p>{p.description}</p><span>Explore {p.name} →</span></div></a>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="image-story"><div class="image-story-photo"><img src="/images/gear-moto-foundation-motorcycle-rider-community-utah.jpg" alt="Illustrative community of riders gathered with their motorcycles at a scenic overlook" loading="lazy"/><span class="image-disclaimer">Illustrative rider-community image</span></div><div class="image-story-copy"><span class="section-label">ALL BIKES. ALL RIDERS.</span><h2>YOU DON'T HAVE TO RIDE ALONE.</h2><p>Sport bikes, cruisers, touring bikes, commuters, new riders and lifelong enthusiasts: our vision includes everyone. Not a riding club. Not a brand. A mission that puts people first.</p><a class="btn btn-red" href="/events/">Meet the Community <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
<section class="action-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-label">MAKE YOUR MARK</span><h2>THERE'S MORE THAN<br/>ONE WAY TO HELP.</h2></div><p>Whether you ride, teach, run a business or simply believe in safer roads, there's a way to help shape GEAR.</p></div><div class="action-grid"><a href="/volunteer/" class="action-card"><span>01 — GET INVOLVED</span><h3>Give Your Time.</h3><p>Help bring rider-centered ideas and community events to life.</p><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a><a href="/partners/" class="action-card"><span>02 — PARTNER WITH US</span><h3>Build Something Bigger.</h3><p>Connect your business or expertise to a meaningful mission.</p><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a><a href="/get-help/" class="action-card"><span>03 — RIDER RESOURCES</span><h3>Find Your Next Step.</h3><p>Explore our developing support programs and availability.</p><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a></div></div></section>
<section class="closing-cta"><div class="wrap"><span class="section-label">BUILT BY RIDERS, FOR RIDERS</span><h2>LET'S MOVE<br/><em>FORWARD. TOGETHER.</em></h2><p>GEAR is in development. Be among the people helping shape what comes next.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-white" href="/contact/">Start a Conversation ↗</a><a class="btn hero-outline" href="/impact/">Our Commitment to Transparency →</a></div></div></section>
</Base>